# Gitea personal access token for the `uploadVisionReleaseToGitea` Gradle task.
#
# This file is a TEMPLATE — the real config lives in `gradle.token.properties`
# which is gitignored. To enable the upload task:
#
#   1. Copy this file -> gradle.token.properties
#      (Windows:    copy gradle.token.properties.example gradle.token.properties
#       bash/POSIX: cp gradle.token.properties.example gradle.token.properties)
#
#   2. Mint a Gitea PAT at http://125.211.45.14:3000/user/settings/applications
#      with `write:repository` scope (enough to create releases + upload
#      assets on the giteaadmin/vision-app repo).
#
#   3. Paste the token below, replacing `<your-token-here>`.
#
#   4. Run `./gradlew uploadVisionReleaseToGitea` after a successful
#      `assembleRelease` (or just `./gradlew assembleRelease` which
#      chains the upload via finalizedBy).
#      The task is idempotent: re-running does NOT create duplicate
#      releases or duplicate assets — it deletes assets with matching
#      filenames first, then uploads fresh.
#
# SECURITY:
#  - gradle.token.properties is gitignored. Do not commit it.
#  - The PAT grants write access to giteaadmin/vision-app. Scope to
#    that one repo when minting (Settings -> Applications -> Generate Token).
#  - Revoke at http://125.211.45.14:3000/user/settings/applications if
#    the token leaks (e.g. accidental paste in chat, accidental commit
#    before the gitignore catches it).
#
# Example values: do NOT put a real (or real-looking) PAT here. The
# `git push` hook and CI logs would surface it. Replace `<your-token-here>`
# in the untracked `gradle.token.properties` copy, never in this template.
#
# Gitea PATs are 40-char lowercase hex. ANY hex token pasted into this
# template (even commented out, even as a placeholder) will be flagged
# by the upload task as a probable leak — keep only `<your-token-here>`.
# If you need to document a PAT shape for a changelog or commit message,
# redact it (e.g. write "7e0...b56" with the middle elided) — never
# paste a real-looking hex string into any tracked file.
GITEA_TOKEN=<your-token-here>
